      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carthage%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Carthaginian newspaper, started in 1872, is still published today, making it one of Mississippi’s oldest continuous papers.",
